message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "Proofs of concept for privacy-preserving e-ID"
authors:
  - family-names: Gasser
    given-names: Linus
    affiliation: EPFL
  - family-names: Kulic
    given-names: Darko
    affiliation: SICPA
  - family-names: Multazzu
