    affiliation: EPFL
repository-code: https://github.com/eid-privacy/zkp-pocs
license: MPL-2.0
abstract: >-
  Proofs of concept for privacy-preserving e-ID: BBS signatures with Bulletproofs
  (docknetwork/crypto) and Noir/UltraHONK circuits for holder binding, unlinkability,
  predicate proofs and revocation, with benchmarks on desktop and Android. The benchmarks
  are the basis of the MS2 report of the grant.
keywords:
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - anonymous credentials
  - BBS
  - Bulletproofs
  - Noir
  - UltraHONK
  - e-ID
  - benchmarks
